                                "type": "paragraph",
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "text": "No, it is specifically designed for farmers growing pulses.\n"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ],
                        "answer_md": "No, it is specifically designed for farmers growing pulses.\n\n"
                    },
                    {
                        "question": "What are the advantages of participating in the training program?",
